  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Do",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Do.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Jeremy Do (MED0002334445) completed his medical degree at Monash University in Melbourne. He has worked several hospital in the Central Coast and Westmead before starting his General Practice career. He has particular interests in cardiovascular health, men's health and chronic disease management.",
      "Outside of work, Jeremy has been a passionate rock climber and boulderer for over a decade."
    ]
